{
  "$comment": "check:response-exposure (apps/api/scripts/audit-response-exposure.mjs) — BUILD_PLAN Phase 12 / Constitution 5 §37, §138 (#19). reviewed: file fragment → why a read of a sensitive column there never reaches a response (each traced Oct 8 2026). notSensitive: table.column the name classifier flags but that is not a secret, with the reason. starBaseline: whole-row reads of tables WITHOUT a sensitive column, per file — a ratchet (only shrinks; --update rewrites it, never the other two lists).",
  "reviewed": {
    "apps/api/src/customer-display/customer-display.repository.ts": "getSession reads public_token_hash so CustomerDisplayService.verify() can compare the display's token in-process; DisplaySessionRow is mapped to the public display state without it",
    "apps/api/src/observability/synthetic-probes.ts": "the db_write probe writes a random UUID and reads it back (read-your-write); it authenticates nothing and the probe result carries only pass/fail",
    "modules/booking/src/customer-booking/booking-verification-center.ts": "resend() reads booking_verification_sessions.phone_hash (and the customer's normalized_phone) only to compare phoneKey(customer phone on record) === session phone_hash in-process before an authorized resend; the response is { status, message } — every list / detail view selects phone_mask only (Booking Phone Verification guide, Oct 31 2026)",
    "modules/checkout/src/checkout/checkout.kysely.repository.ts": "card_pin_hash is read to verify a gift-card PIN at redemption; resolveCrossTenantGiftCard's pinHash is consumed by redeemGift — CheckoutService.giftCardLookup maps the card to { reference, cardNumberMasked, balanceCents, status } only",
    "modules/checkout/src/skip-line-checkout/skip-line-checkout.repository.ts": "savedCardToken: the processor token is handed to the gateway charge in SkipLineCheckoutService.pay and never returned",
    "modules/memberships/src/membership-renewal-charge.ts": "defaultSavedCard: the processor token is passed to authorizeAndCapture for the renewal charge; the job result carries only the processor response",
    "modules/payments/src/hardware-payment/hardware-payment.kysely.repository.ts": "getActivePaymentMethod / addPaymentMethod carry gateway_payment_method_token for the autopay charge; the service returns PaymentMethodView (no token) — Phase 12 fix, hardware-payment.service.vitest.spec.ts",
    "modules/super-admin/src/super-admin-staff/global-tech-admin.service.ts": "duplicates() groups on coalesce(phone_hash, email) as a key that is never returned (groups carry profile id / code / name / status only); detail() selects explicit columns (Phase 12); merge() (WF merge Oct 12 2026) reads the duplicate's phone_hash / email_normalized only to hand them to the surviving profile inside the transaction — never returned",
    "modules/identity/src/auth/biometric-credentials.ts": "BUILD_PLAN Phase 13 D: verifyAndRotate reads device_biometric_credentials.secret_hash / previous_secret_hash / device_key_hash only to compare them in-process (timing-safe) with the hash of what the device presented; VerifyResult carries the credential id, user, tenant, device and claims — never a hash — and the controller answers with the login body + the NEW secret, which exists only in that one response",
    "modules/communications/src/tenant-messaging/platform-messaging-provisioner.ts": "B-16 (Oct 20 2026): reads tenant_messaging_credentials.auth_token_enc (the salon's sealed subaccount token) only to ProviderSecrets.decrypt it in-process for the next Twilio call of a resumable provisioning run; ProvisionResult carries SIDs and the number only, and the audit metadata never the token (asserted in platform-messaging-provisioner.pgtest)",
    "modules/queue/src/serving/manager-pin.kysely.ts": "B-19 (Oct 22 2026): KyselyManagerPinPort.verify reads users.pin_hash only to compare the manager's PIN in-process (verifyPassword); the port answers { userId, name } or null — the hash never leaves it and nothing is returned to a client",
    "modules/workforce/src/payroll/payroll-paycheck.service.ts": "acknowledgeCashByTechnician reads cash_handoff_token_hash only to compare the Tech App's handoff code in-process (sha256, with the expiry); PAYOUT_SELECT / toPayoutView never carry the hash — the wire has the expiry (cashHandoffTokenExpiresAt) and the code is handed to the manager's screen once, by issueHandoffToken",
    "modules/communications/src/tenant-messaging/registration-sync.service.ts": "Phone & Messaging round 2 PM-03/PM-04 (Oct 30 2026): accountFor() reads the salon default tenant_messaging_credentials.auth_token_enc only to ProviderSecrets.decrypt it in-process as the Basic-auth secret for the READ-ONLY provider registration reads (twilio-registration-client.ts); the stored snapshots and SyncRunView carry provider ids, sanitized status tokens, states, error classes and times only — asserted by the secret-safety scan in phone-messaging-round2.pgtest (no SID / token / ciphertext in any response or audit row)",
    "modules/communications/src/tenant-messaging/tenant-messaging-credentials.service.ts": "the salon's Twilio credentials: auth_token_enc / api_key_secret_enc are read to decrypt in-process (Test Verify, Test SMS, the validate-before-save provider check) and to fingerprint the configuration; MaskedCredentials returns last-4 + hasApiKeySecret only (asserted in tenant-messaging-credentials.pgtest)"
  },
